==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*to že}}. Can be analyzed as {{af|ru|тот|же|t1=that}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|то́же|pos=adv}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-тоже.ogg}}

===Adverb===
{{ru-adv|то́же}}

# [[also]], [[too]], [[as well]], [[likewise]]
#: {{ux|ru|[[я|Я]] [[там]] [[быть|был]], [[Ива́н]] '''то́же'''.|t=I was there and so was Ivan.}}
# {{lb|ru|in negative constructions}} [[either]], [[neither]], [[nor]]

====Synonyms====
* {{l|ru|та́кже}}

====Descendants====
